+ * extra block periods (5.33 ms each) of slack. Demon's Souls' MultiStream
+ * filled exactly the next block, its SPU mixer finished after we had already
+ * read it about half the time, and the late block played a ring lap later:
+ * choppy, crackling audio. Costs n blocks of output latency. */
