+/* getenv with the answer cached per call site's literal: the FIFO walker runs
+ * tens of thousands of times a second and asked the CRT for a dozen
+ * diagnostic variables on every pass (getenv takes a lock and scans the
+ * environment). Keys are string literals, so the pointer identifies them.
